  {
   "name": "control_confirm",
   "comment": "SELECTIVITY DISCRIMINATOR (replaces avatar_confirm): respond_votes>=2 AND distinct responding actions = Count(Neighbours(region, responds_kind)) is STRICTLY LESS than the full repertoire = Count(Neighbours(game, has_action_kind)). The omni-responding environment (floor, countdown) responds to every action -> distinct==full -> Lt fails -> never confirmed. A selectively-controlled element responds under a proper subset -> Lt holds. Mints/attaches a PERSISTENT ControlledElement keyed on the region's positional footprint (fkey=rid, stable across frames), Body controls it, it comprises the region. Idempotent (add_node_if_absent + add_edge + same dirty) -> self-terminating. game-blind.",
