  {
   "name": "controlled_bounds",
   "comment": "ORDER-N aggregate (rename of avatar_bounds): the ControlledElement el is a Region-of-Regions; count/centroid/motion are the weighted aggregate over the UNION of its comprises Regions. count=Sum(r.count); cy=Sum(r.cy*r.count)/count; cx likewise; cy_prev/cx_prev SAVED FIRST (effects apply in order) so drow/dcol = whole-element motion whether 1 piece or N. UNCHANGED math; aggregates el over comprises instead of Body over controls. where reads a component count+cy+cx so precise-dirty re-wakes the aggregate when any comprises Region's centroid settles. Idempotent (fires once per comprises binding, same aggregate). First-frame guard: drow/dcol read 0 until bounds_inited=1 (set after, so the element's first frame is no-motion, not absolute-position). manifestation-agnostic.",
